# ============================================
# ECDI .gitignore
# 目录名模式（无前缀）会匹配任意层级的同名目录，
# 因此 x64/、Debug/ 同时覆盖根目录与 ECDI/ 下的产物。
# ============================================

# ===== 编译输出目录（任意层级）=====
x64/
x86/
Debug/
Release/
build/
build-*/
out/

# ===== ECDI/ 下的 VS 输出（显式列出，便于阅读）=====
ECDI/Debug/
ECDI/x64/
ECDI/Release/

# ===== 可执行文件 / 库 / 调试符号 =====
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.idb

# ===== 编译器中间产物 =====
*.obj
*.o
*.tlog
*.log
*.recipe
*.unsuccessfulbuild
*.lastbuildstate
*.FileListAbsolute.txt
*.aps
*.rcb
*.res
*.exp
*.map

# ===== Visual Studio IDE =====
.vs/
*.vcxproj.user
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
ipch/

# ===== CMake =====
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
compile_commands.json
CTestTestfile.cmake
*.cmake.stamp

# ===== 工具目录（私有，不提交）=====
.workbuddy/
.mimocode/
.vscode/
.idea/

# ===== 临时 / 诊断文件 =====
error.txt
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

